Third-party data in this folder

- Open Images V7: image ids and human-verified image-level labels, from the annotations published by
  Google LLC under CC BY 4.0 (https://storage.googleapis.com/openimages/web/factsfigures_v7.html).
  The images themselves are listed by Open Images as CC BY 2.0 and are not included; run.py fetch
  downloads them from the Open Images bucket.
- Places365: validation image file numbers and their scene categories, from the Places365-Standard
  file lists (http://places2.csail.mit.edu). The images are for non-commercial research and education
  and their copyright belongs to the image owners; they are not included.

Everything else in this folder (agent labels, splits, mining pool, Qwen inputs) is ours, CC BY 4.0.
